00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:07.530
Microsoft Defender for Cloud
can automatically onboard Azure

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:11.460
resources and even
non-Azure resources

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:14.280
by installing the
right extension.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:18.060
When you enable an extension,
Defender for Cloud installs it

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:23.400
